<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Live Amadeus access is ready</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Velexis assigned the live Amadeus office {{officeId}} to your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}). Your live Amadeus connection on the Velexis account is now active.</p>
    <p>Your storefront keeps selling in test mode until your OTA goes live. Once the rest of the setup is done, you can switch it to live in the portal.</p>
    <p>Your Amadeus connections in the portal: <a href="{{amadeusUrl}}">{{amadeusUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
